      "writtenOn": "2022-07-19T08:15:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Do you mean the MMI should call both method and remove this call from the hfp.kt file?\n\nYes exactly and if `EnableSlc` takes a connection it would look like\n\n```\nself.connection \u003d self.host.Connect(address\u003dpts_addr).connection\nself.hfp.EnableSlc(connection\u003dself.connection)\n```",
      "parentUuid": "a0f79dfc_d69a18ee",
      "revId": "f88a0d3be6b7f5332a6b812b8b6c4b4a49322fda",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
